# 'KASSA' is the word on the street....

[![African Drumming Palmwoods](/media/2013/11/African-Drumming-Palmwoods.jpg)](/media/2013/11/African-Drumming-Palmwoods.jpg) Hi drummers, dancers and lovers of music from all around the world.  Our new courses start this week which we are incredibly excited about.  The rhythm 'Kassa' will be taught including all djembe, dundun, sangban and kenkeni parts. There will be a student performance this December 13th at Nights on Ocean Street Market for all students.  So come and join in the fun! and don't forget all students are welcome to come and drum for the Tuesday night dance coop for a gold coin donation! and extra hour of drumming in an ensemble setting! Yay! See you in class :)
